root = true

[*]
charset = utf-8
end_of_line = lf
insert_final_newline = true
trim_trailing_whitespace = true

[*.{js,jsx,ts,tsx,astro,html,css}]
indent_style = space
indent_size = 2

[*.md]
trim_trailing_whitespace = false
```

## 4. Crear .gitattributes

Crea `.gitattributes` en la raíz:
```
* text=auto eol=lf encoding=UTF-8
*.{js,jsx,ts,tsx,astro} text eol=lf encoding=UTF-8
*.{json,md,html,css} text eol=lf encoding=UTF-8
*.{png,jpg,jpeg,gif,svg,ico,webp} binary
*.pdf binary